# infostore
InfoStoreAdd runcmd   drun
InfoStoreAdd acmecmd  acme
InfoStoreAdd termcmd  alacritty
InfoStoreAdd ffxcmd   firefox
InfoStoreAdd muscmd   feishin
InfoStoreAdd stmcmd   steam
InfoStoreAdd discmd   vesktop
InfoStoreAdd filecmd  thunar
InfoStoreAdd passcmd  keepassxc
InfoStoreAdd scrotcmd shot

# icons, placement, focus
Style * !Icon, CascadePlacement, SloppyFocus, \
        FPFocusByFunctionWarpPointer, FPGrabFocus

# hide geometry window and enable opaque move
GeometryWindow Hide
OpaqueMoveSize unlimited
Style * ResizeOpaque, SnapAttraction 15 SameType ScreenAll, SnapGrid

# window rules
Style *             StartsOnDesk 0

Style Alacritty     Sticky
Style Thunar        Sticky

Style firefox       StartsOnPage 0 0, Maximize

Style feishin       StartsOnPage 1 0, Maximize
Style discord       StartsOnPage 1 0, Maximize
Style vesktop       StartsOnPage 1 0, Maximize
Style *nicotine*    StartsOnPage 1 0, Maximize
Style qBittorrent   StartsOnPage 1 0, Maximize, SkipMapping

Style steam*        StartsOnPage 0 1

Style .gamescope*   StartsOnPage 1 1, StaysOnTop
Style PrismLauncher StartsOnPage 1 1
Style Minecraft*    StartsOnPage 1 1

# configure desktops
+-----+-----+
| 0 0 | 1 0 |
+-----+-----+
| 0 1 | 1 1 |
+-----+-----+
DesktopSize 2x2
EwmhNumberOfDesktops 1
EdgeResistance -1
EwmhBaseStruts screen $[monitor.primary] 0 0 0 0 # struts updated in panel cfg

# main config
DefaultFont "xft:SFProText:size=12"
Style * BorderWidth 4, HandleWidth 4
BorderStyle -- Flat

# title bar config
Style * Title, !StippledTitle, !StickyStippledTitle
TitleStyle LeftJustified Height 28 -- Flat
ButtonStyle 1 Pixmap menu.xpm -- Flat
ButtonStyle 6 Pixmap min.xpm -- Flat
ButtonStyle 4 Pixmap max.xpm -- Flat
ButtonStyle 2 Pixmap close.xpm -- Flat
ButtonStyle All AllInactive Pixmap nul.xpm -- Flat

# colorsets
#   0   -> inactive window titles
# 1 & 2 -> titles / menus, inactive / active
# 3 & 4 -> borders, inactive / active
Colorset 0 fg black, bg black
Colorset 1 fg white, bg black, hi #404040, sh #404040
Colorset 2 fg white, bg #1d1d1d
Colorset 3 bg #404040
Colorset 4 bg #737373

Style * Colorset 0, HilightColorset 1, \
        BorderColorset 3, HilightBorderColorset 4

MenuStyle * MenuColorset 1, ActiveColorset 2, \
            BorderWidth 4, Hilight3DOff, HilightBack, \
            ItemFormat "%|     %l%>     %|", VerticalItemSpacing 6 7, \
            SeparatorsShort, TrianglesSolid

# init
Read binds
Read haikupanel
Read menus

DestroyFunc InitFunction
AddToFunc   InitFunction
+ I Exec exec nm-applet
+ I Exec exec qbittorrent
+ I Exec exec $[infostore.stmcmd] -system-composer
+ I Exec exec $[infostore.discmd]